{
  "id": "2SA.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samueli 19",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Yoabuni jed'ani, Hayyichi ilma isaa Absalomu jed'e aka hama laalefate bohu jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi dabsachaani worri nyaapa dabsate guyya suni garagalte boha askarti Daudi ch'ufati tate; wonti akanatiifi askartini guyya suni hayyichi ilma ufiti bohu jira, d'ageete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri ch'allise dirati dachae, aka askarti nyaapa baqate ch'eeraani galte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyichi mata hagogate faarse bohe waan jed'e, Ee ilma kiyya! Absalomuni ilma kiyya! Ilma kiyya Absalomuni!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabuni mana hayyicha d'aqe waan jed'eeni, Atini arra askarti tante yayu ch'eersite, nama lubbu tanteetifi ta ilmaani teeti ta d'iiratifi ta dubraatifi, nad'eeni tanteetifi gaarayoota tantele baase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini nama si jibbu jaalate nama si jaalatu jibbita! Wonti atini arra taate kunini aka atini askartifi worra gugurda isiile womatu indarre garsiifti. Wonti anini arge kana — aka sila nuni ch'ufti hobaane Absalomuni jiraatu feeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma beeni, worra kanke garaa jabeesi, anini maqa AABBO Waaqatini kakhad'a yo atini akasi intolchini bori askartini tunini nami tokoleeni si bira ineju. Tunini badi guddo toko, ta siti d'uftu, ta atini haguma d'alatte taka inargini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani hayyichi kae d'aqe fullo dira d'aatu tae. Jennaani askartini isaa aka inni achi jiru d'ageennaani ch'ufti fulla isaa d'ufte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Daudini Yerusalemuti deebie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato wonti kunini ch'ufti tau jirtu worri Israeli baqate worra ufiti dachae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gochiti Israeli fulla ch'ufati aka hama wold'abde, duuba worri waan woliini jed'e, Hayyu Daudini nyaapa keenna duraa nu baase, harka worra Filistile jalaa nu baase, ammo amma inni yayu Absalomu duraa baqate lafa keesaa bahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nu Absalomu qara aka hayyu keenna muunne, ammo amma ya woraana keesati isa ijeesani. Isani maanifi nami tokoleeni aka Daudi deebisu indubbanne?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dubbini worri Israeli jed'e suni Daudi geennaani inni jara qaalole kaani, Sadokifi Abiathari, gara jaarole Yuda erge, Isani aka hayyu mana isati galchani maanifi eege aantani? Jed'e gaafate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nu woli fiit'a, foonumafi d'iiga, isani maanifi deebisa tiyya eege aantani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Daudini waan worraani jed'e, Waan isani Amasaani jettani, Atini fiit'a tiyya, armaa achi anini gudda askarti tiyya si tolcha fulla Yoabu. Yo anini iraa oole, Waaqi na ijeesinna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dubbini isaa tunini worra Yuda ch'ufa garaa seente, worri qonqo isati erge waan jed'e, siifi jari kanke ch'ufti gala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato deebiu jiru, hayyuuni worra Yuda ka Gilgali, isa taakisiisu d'ufe galaana Yordaniti wolwoldaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.5+2SA.16.6+2SA.16.7+2SA.16.8+2SA.16.9+2SA.16.10+2SA.16.11+2SA.16.12+2SA.16.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 16.5-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ammalle Shimeini ilmi Gera, ka gosa Benjamini, ka Bahurimu bahe, utaale hayyu Daudi argu d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni nama kuma toko ka gosa Benjaminitini woliini yaani, Sibaleni, ka hojattu worra Saulo, ilmaani isaa kud'ani shanifi hojatu isaa nama diddamatini d'ufe hayyu durati galaana Yordanitini bahani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri galaana taake aka jara hayyu gegeese waan hayyuuni fed'u ch'ufa tolchufi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Daudini Shimei naasu agarsiise",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato hayyuuni kurfefate galaana taaku jiru, Shimeini isa durati lafa d'ae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan jed'eeni, Hayyicha, waan hamtu anini gaafa atini Yerusalemu baate si tolche ch'ufa biraa naa deemi, waan ch'ufa ded'i, deebite qalbi keesa naa inkeyaatini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aabbo anini imbeekha ya siti dabe, tanaafi anini gosa gara mirga jirtu keesa nama ch'ufa durati si arga d'ufe, ee hayyicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Abashaini, ilmi Seruya waan jed'e, Shimeini duu male waan inni nama AABBO Waaqi fohate muude abaareefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo Daudini Abashaifi oboleesa isaa Yoabuni waan jed'e, Eenuti dubbi tana isaniini gahe, ilmaani Seruya? Isani na d'ibu feetani, hayyuuni Israeli amma anuma, nama Israeli tokole arra inijeesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba inni Shimeiti kakhate waan jed'eeni, Atini indootu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Daudini Mefiboshethi nahe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
